#<font color=""></font>
Nicola helped me to sort and pack away my stuff.[l] After that, we decided to go to sleep. [p]

[current layer="message0"]
[layopt layer="message0" visible=false]
[layopt layer="message1" visible=false]

[bg  time="1000"  method="crossfade"  storage="cg/cg02_euphi-nico-pajamas.png"  ]
[tb_cg  id="CG2"  ]
[wait  time="1500"  ]

[current layer="message1"]
[layopt layer="message0" visible=false]
[layopt layer="message1" visible=true]

[font  size="28"  color="0x85e085"  face="earthorbiter"  ]
Nicola:
[font  size="28"  color="0xffffff"  face="TitilliumWeb-Regular"  ]
_ Well at least, you’ve got good fashion sense![l] Maybe I should get into working out too, to get a sweet and slender body like yours! [l][r][r]
[font  size="28"  color="0xffffff"  face="TitilliumWeb-Regular"  italic="true"  ]
She’s one bold gal...[l]
As she sat down on her bed, a little tin looking item dropped onto the floor.[p]
[font  size="28"  color="0xffffff"  face="TitilliumWeb-Regular"  italic="false"  ]
[stopbgm  time="2000"  fadeout="true"  ]
[font  size="28"  color="0x85e085"  face="earthorbiter"  ]
Nicola:
[font  size="28"  color="0xffffff"  face="TitilliumWeb-Regular"  ]
_ Ah, that’s where it was! [l][r][r]
[font  size="28"  color="0xff8080"  face="earthorbiter"  ]
Euphie:
[font  size="28"  color="0xffffff"  face="TitilliumWeb-Regular"  ]
_ What is that?[p]
[wait  time="250"  ]
[playbgm   time="1000"  loop="true"  storage="Music/What_a_Day_Scramel.ogg"  ]

[current layer="message1"]
[layopt layer="message0" visible=false]
[layopt layer="message1" visible=false]

[bg  time="1000"  method="crossfade"  storage="cg/cg03_euphie-nico-pajamas.png"  ]

[current layer="message1"]
[layopt layer="message0" visible=false]
[layopt layer="message1" visible=true]

[font  size="28"  color="0x85e085"  face="earthorbiter"  ]
Nicola:
[font  size="28"  color="0xffffff"  face="TitilliumWeb-Regular"  ]
_ It’s a music box![l] I got it from my dad who was also an astronaut.[l][r][r]

[font  size="28"  color="0xff8080"  face="earthorbiter"  ]
Euphie:
[font  size="28"  color="0xffffff"  face="TitilliumWeb-Regular"  ]
_ I see. [l]Is he retired now? [l][r][r]

[current layer="message0"]
[layopt layer="message0" visible=false]
[layopt layer="message1" visible=false]
[bg  time="1000"  method="crossfade"  storage="cg/cg02_nicoeuphie1.png"  ]
[current layer="message1"]
[layopt layer="message0" visible=false]
[layopt layer="message1" visible=true]

[font  size="28"  color="0x85e085"  face="earthorbiter"  ]
Nicola:
[font  size="28"  color="0xffffff"  face="TitilliumWeb-Regular"  ]
_ That’s one way of putting it, I guess... [l]He was on a rescue mission for a space station surrounded by dangerous meteorites. [l]He gave up his own life to save others. [l][r][r]

[font  size="28"  color="0xff8080"  face="earthorbiter"  ]
Euphie:
[font  size="28"  color="0xffffff"  face="TitilliumWeb-Regular"  ]
_ Oh, sorry... [l][r][r]

[font  size="28"  color="0xffffff"  face="TitilliumWeb-Regular"  italic="true"  ]
Here you go, making yet another mistake. [l]How insensitive can you be, Euphie.[p]
[font  size="28"  color="0xffffff"  face="TitilliumWeb-Regular"  italic="false"  ]

[font  size="28"  color="0x85e085"  face="earthorbiter"  ]
Nicola:
[font  size="28"  color="0xffffff"  face="TitilliumWeb-Regular"  ]
_  Oh, don’t dwell on it too much! [l]I’m actually quite proud of him. [l]He died protecting people, and he made quite a name for himself by doing that.[l] It inspired me to learn more about stars, to make sure those kind of incidents never happen again.[l] That’s how and why I ended up here, studying the cosmos. [l]It’s been a real long time now that I think about it. [l]I actually don’t remember him much. [l]But when he gave me this precious lil’ thing before going on his last mission in space, it truly left an impression on me. [l]I’m thirty, so this must have been like what, 25 years ago?[p]

[font  size="28"  color="0xff8080"  face="earthorbiter"  ]
Euphie:
[font  size="28"  color="0xffffff"  face="TitilliumWeb-Regular"  ]
_ You’re thirty?! [l][r][r]

[font  size="28"  color="0xffffff"  face="TitilliumWeb-Regular"  italic="true"  ]
Insensitive. [l]Again. [l][r][r]
[font  size="28"  color="0xffffff"  face="TitilliumWeb-Regular"  italic="false"  ]

[font  size="28"  color="0x85e085"  face="earthorbiter"  ]
Nicola:
[font  size="28"  color="0xffffff"  face="TitilliumWeb-Regular"  ]
_ Ahah![l] Surprised, right? [l]Tell me, what age did you think I was? [l][r][r]

[font  size="28"  color="0xff8080"  face="earthorbiter"  ]
Euphie:
[font  size="28"  color="0xffffff"  face="TitilliumWeb-Regular"  ]
_ Uh... [l]I’d say... [l]I thought you would be at least my age, 26...[p]

[font  size="28"  color="0x85e085"  face="earthorbiter"  ]
Nicola:
[font  size="28"  color="0xffffff"  face="TitilliumWeb-Regular"  ]
_ Come on, be honest.[l][r][r]

[font  size="28"  color="0xff8080"  face="earthorbiter"  ]
Euphie:
[font  size="28"  color="0xffffff"  face="TitilliumWeb-Regular"  ]
_ ...[l]You look like you’re 20. [l][r][r]

[font  size="28"  color="0x85e085"  face="earthorbiter"  ]
Nicola:
[font  size="28"  color="0xffffff"  face="TitilliumWeb-Regular"  ]
_ Teeeeeeeeeeh![l][r][r]

[font  size="28"  color="0xffffff"  face="TitilliumWeb-Regular"  italic="true"  ]
She made a really high pitched sound, out of this world. [l]I can’t even tell what it’s supposed to express.[p]
[font  size="28"  color="0xffffff"  face="TitilliumWeb-Regular"  italic="false"  ]

[font  size="28"  color="0x85e085"  face="earthorbiter"  ]
Nicola:
[font  size="28"  color="0xffffff"  face="TitilliumWeb-Regular"  ]
_ Geez, I’m so glad I’m so short. [l]It’s thanks to that most people think I look young. [l]Some ladies just age like fine wine, and I’m sure you’ll be no exception! [l][r][r]

[font  size="28"  color="0xff8080"  face="earthorbiter"  ]
Euphie:
[font  size="28"  color="0xffffff"  face="TitilliumWeb-Regular"  ]
_ Uh... [l]Thanks...?[p]

[font  size="28"  color="0x85e085"  face="earthorbiter"  ]
Nicola:
[font  size="28"  color="0xffffff"  face="TitilliumWeb-Regular"  ]
_ Don’t be so uptight! [l]Some girls would kill for a body like yours! [l][r][r]

[layopt layer="message1" visible=false]
[bg  time="1000"  method="crossfade"  storage="cg/cg04_bottle.png" wait=true ]
[layopt layer="message1" visible=true]

[font  size="28"  color="0xffffff"  face="TitilliumWeb-Regular"  italic="true"  ]
I look up at her and it’s then that I see she’s clutching a bottle of liquor. [l]I’m quite unsure if it’s allowed, or even healthy in any way, but I’ll mind my own business.[p]
[font  size="28"  color="0xffffff"  face="TitilliumWeb-Regular"  italic="false"  ]

[bg  time="1000"  method="crossfade"  storage="cg/cg02_nicoeuphie2.png"  ]

[font  size="28"  color="0x85e085"  face="earthorbiter"  ]
Nicola:
[font  size="28"  color="0xffffff"  face="TitilliumWeb-Regular"  ]
_ Actually...[l] it broke a while back.[l][r][r]

[font  size="28"  color="0xff8080"  face="earthorbiter"  ]
Euphie:
[font  size="28"  color="0xffffff"  face="TitilliumWeb-Regular"  ]
_ Uh? [l]What broke? [l][r][r]

[font  size="28"  color="0x85e085"  face="earthorbiter"  ]
Nicola:
[font  size="28"  color="0xffffff"  face="TitilliumWeb-Regular"  ]
_ This lil’ no good box. [l]I used to wear it on a necklace, but it fell off with the weight of the music box itself, since the chain was so used with time. [l]I think that was a bit before you arrived.[l] And now, the melody is all screwed up! [p]

[font  size="28"  color="0xffffff"  face="TitilliumWeb-Regular"  italic="true"  ]
Maybe that’s why she’s been drinking. [l]It must mean much more to her than she thinks it does... [l][r][r]
[font  size="28"  color="0xffffff"  face="TitilliumWeb-Regular"  italic="false"  ]

[font  size="28"  color="0x85e085"  face="earthorbiter"  ]
Nicola:
[font  size="28"  color="0xffffff"  face="TitilliumWeb-Regular"  ]
_ What about you? [l]Do you have a little keepsake for yourself? [l][r][r]

[font  size="28"  color="0xff8080"  face="earthorbiter"  ]
Euphie:
[font  size="28"  color="0xffffff"  face="TitilliumWeb-Regular"  ]
_ Uh... [l][r][r]

[font  size="28"  color="0xffffff"  face="TitilliumWeb-Regular"  italic="true"  ]
Now that I think about it, not really. [l]I’ve never really been that close to my parents, and I’m not close enough with my friends for anyone to give me any kind of cherished item. [p]
[font  size="28"  color="0xffffff"  face="TitilliumWeb-Regular"  italic="false"  ]

[bg  time="1000"  method="crossfade"  storage="cg/cg02_nicoeuphie1.png"  ]

[font  size="28"  color="0x85e085"  face="earthorbiter"  ]
Nicola:
[font  size="28"  color="0xffffff"  face="TitilliumWeb-Regular"  ]
_ You can have it 
! [l][r][r]

[font  size="28"  color="0xff8080"  face="earthorbiter"  ]
Euphie:
[font  size="28"  color="0xffffff"  face="TitilliumWeb-Regular"  ]
_ What?! [l][r][r]

[font  size="28"  color="0x85e085"  face="earthorbiter"  ]
Nicola:
[font  size="28"  color="0xffffff"  face="TitilliumWeb-Regular"  ]
_ It’s broken, and you’re probably better at handling these things than I am... [l][r][r]

[font  size="28"  color="0xff8080"  face="earthorbiter"  ]
Euphie:
[font  size="28"  color="0xffffff"  face="TitilliumWeb-Regular"  ]
_ It looks quite valuable, are you sure? [p]

[font  size="28"  color="0x85e085"  face="earthorbiter"  ]
Nicola:
[font  size="28"  color="0xffffff"  face="TitilliumWeb-Regular"  ]
_ Yeah, yeah, sure! How good is a music box if it doesn’t work? [l]Also, sometimes, you’ve gotta let go of the past... [l][r][r]

[font  size="28"  color="0xffffff"  face="TitilliumWeb-Regular"  italic="true"  ]
After saying all that?! [l]Don’t be so dramatic... [l][r]...[l]Actually, maybe I could get someone to fix it and give it back to her. [l]Joshua is a mechanic, right? [l]Surely he could find a way to repair it. [l]That’s the least I could do. [p]
[font  size="28"  color="0xffffff"  face="TitilliumWeb-Regular"  italic="false"  ]

[font  size="28"  color="0xff8080"  face="earthorbiter"  ]
Euphie:
[font  size="28"  color="0xffffff"  face="TitilliumWeb-Regular"  ]
_ Then I’ll hold onto it... [l]For now. [l][r][r]

[font  size="28"  color="0x85e085"  face="earthorbiter"  ]
Nicola:
[font  size="28"  color="0xffffff"  face="TitilliumWeb-Regular"  ]
_ Great! [l]It’ll be a great good luck charm. [l]Let’s hear the melody again together someday, if you ever manage to fix it! [p]

[bg  time="1000"  method="crossfade"  storage="black.png"  ]
[font  size="28"  color="0xffffff"  face="TitilliumWeb-Regular"  italic="true"  ]
She tosses the small bottle away, and dives into her covers. [l][r][r]
[font  size="28"  color="0xffffff"  face="TitilliumWeb-Regular"  italic="false"  ]

[font  size="28"  color="0x85e085"  face="earthorbiter"  ]
Nicola:
[font  size="28"  color="0xffffff"  face="TitilliumWeb-Regular"  ]
_ Oof! [l]I'm pooped. [l]Well, goodnight Euphie. [l]Don't worry if you're having trouble getting to sleep. [l]It's only natural for a first night in space. [l][r][r]

[font  size="28"  color="0xff8080"  face="earthorbiter"  ]
Euphie:
[font  size="28"  color="0xffffff"  face="TitilliumWeb-Regular"  ]
_ Thanks. [l]Good night to you too... [p]

[font  size="28"  color="0xffffff"  face="TitilliumWeb-Regular"  italic="true"  ]
I put the music box into my blouse pocket, before falling back onto my bed. [l][r][r]
[font  size="28"  color="0xffffff"  face="TitilliumWeb-Regular"  italic="false"  ]

[font  size="28"  color="0xff8080"  face="earthorbiter"  ]
Euphie:
[font  size="28"  color="0xffffff"  face="TitilliumWeb-Regular"  ]
_  Ah! [p]

I let out a sigh of relief. [l]I could finally lie down. [l][r][r]I've spent probably more than 24 hours awake. [l]I couldn't get a decent night's sleep because of all the stress of leaving Earth. [l][r][r]By lying down, I felt like I couldn’t get up even if I wanted to. [l]I immediately pull the cover above my body, and close my eyes.[p]
My first day in space. [l]Weirdly enough, it's oddly similar to one's surroundings on Earth. [l]Simply because everything is still man made, like an extension from what you already see on the planet. [l][r][r]There are rules, communities, and everything is all the same... [l]Aside that you’re not bound to earth.[p]
Before I even realize it’s there, my consciousness drives me to sleep while holding Nicola’s precious music box.[p]

